<title>USA: Ride gets $26 mln in preseason orders.</title>
<headline>Ride gets $26 mln in preseason orders.</headline>
<dateline>PRESTON, Wash. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ride Inc Wednesday said as of June 15th it had accepted orders totalling about $26 million for 1997 shipments.</p>
<p>North American orders totaled $17 million, while international orders totaled $9 million.</p>
<p>Orders for snowboards, boots and bindings accounted for $20 million while orders for apparel and accessories comprised the remaining $6 million.</p>
</text>
